@title Prescription refill flow
@subtitle From the patient app to the pharmacy
@author Integrations team
@date 2026-09-30

!!! Controlled substances are never refilled through the app.

kpi EHR check | within 3 s
kpi Pharmacy acknowledgement | within 30 s
kpi Confirmation in the app | within 10 s of the request

## Refill sequence

diagram refill sequence title="Refill request"
refill: app "Patient App" user
refill: svc "Refill Service" svc
refill: ehr "Clinic EHR" ext
refill: rx "Pharmacy Portal" ext
refill: app -> svc : request refill
refill: svc -> ehr : check active prescription and refills left
refill: alt "Clinic approves"
refill: ehr --> svc : approved, 2 refills remaining
refill: svc -> rx : e-prescription, NCPDP SCRIPT
refill: rx --> svc : accepted, ready in 2 hours
refill: svc --> app : refill confirmed
refill: else "Clinic declines"
refill: ehr --> svc : denied, visit needed
refill: svc --> app : book a visit
refill: end

## Service targets

data targets = call,seconds; EHR check,3; Pharmacy acknowledgement,30; Confirmation shown in the app,10
chart hbar targets y=seconds unit=s labels title="Target time per call, in seconds"

table = call,target; EHR check,within 3 s; Pharmacy acknowledgement,within 30 s; Confirmation shown in the app,within 10 s of the request

## Rules

cards
### Controlled substances
!! **Controlled substances are never refilled through the app.**
### Supply limit
A refill covers at most a 90-day supply.
### After-hours requests
Requests made after 21:00 wait in a queue until 07:00.
